{"title":"계속 함께","artist":"키타니 타츠야","sourceId":"reference:Bchoi8dTrHFq79qCJ3Ex","sourceHash":"02e6be995e3fd01c6b4540e447660c3978b3925dbdfc21e44ecbc263447e6700","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":26103921,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":21.04,"end":24.66,"text":"充電器を貸して！ またあなたのせいであたしすり減った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":24.66,"end":28.01,"text":"終電見逃してまたあたしのせいで帰れなくなった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":28.01,"end":31.66,"text":"繋がっていようね、消耗戦に持ち込んで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.66,"end":33.78,"text":"お互いに足を引っ張ったアオハル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":33.78,"end":37.63,"text":"沈殿した思い出でずうっといっしょ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.16,"end":45.85,"text":"参観日にだって誰からも見られていない気がしたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":45.85,"end":49.33,"text":"散々シニカって昼の街に期待しないようにしたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":49.33,"end":53.04,"text":"そうやって守った孤独さえめちゃくちゃになった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":53.04,"end":55.1,"text":"あたしいつだって死にたくて仕方ない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":55.1,"end":58.08,"text":"こんな顔だいじにしたいと思えないもん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":58.08,"end":59.74,"text":"共に過ごした日々が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":59.74,"end":61.49,"text":"ささやかな幸せが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":61.49,"end":64.83,"text":"かけがえのないトラウマになってたらいいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":64.83,"end":70.59,"text":"はなればなれなんて誰かが吐かせたバグだよね？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":70.59,"end":74.31,"text":"あなたの一生の後悔として添い遂げるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":74.31,"end":76.26,"text":"Q. 大切なものって、なあに？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":76.26,"end":77.86,"text":"A. 今失くしたそれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":77.86,"end":80.07,"text":"あたしと間違いを犯しちゃったんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":80.07,"end":81.62,"text":"取り返しがつかないね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":81.62,"end":83.65,"text":"健やかなるときも病める時も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":83.65,"end":87.56,"text":"グロい履歴の中でずうっといっしょ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":99.13,"end":102.82,"text":"もうちょっとふつうに悲しいこと悲しいと思いたかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":102.82,"end":106.24000000000001,"text":"長調のチューンに感情委託して楽になりたかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":106.24000000000001,"end":109.8,"text":"「せいぜい一生懸命に生きてくださいね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":109.8,"end":111.9,"text":"あたしいつだって死にたくて仕方ない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":111.9,"end":114.91,"text":"あんな歌の言いなりになっていたくないの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":114.91,"end":116.62,"text":"あなただけひとりで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":116.62,"end":118.33,"text":"あたしの目を盗んで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":118.33,"end":120.99,"text":"幸せになろうなんて思わないで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":120.99,"end":124.38,"text":"髪を乾かしてくれた夜から","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":124.38,"end":127.67,"text":"あたしは壊されたんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":127.67,"end":131.26,"text":"あなたの一生の後悔として添い遂げるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":131.26,"end":134.6,"text":"外れなくなってしまった指輪みたいに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":134.6,"end":138.13,"text":"何度もずっとフラッシュバックしている、最低だよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":138.13,"end":141.74,"text":"一緒に居た時の方があたし可愛かったなあ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":141.74,"end":145.36,"text":"あなたの一生の後悔として添い遂げるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":145.36,"end":147.39,"text":"Q. 大切なものって、なあに？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":147.39,"end":148.99,"text":"A. 今失くしたそれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":148.99,"end":151.1,"text":"あたしと間違いを犯しちゃったんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":151.1,"end":152.79,"text":"取り返しがつかないね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":152.79,"end":154.86,"text":"健やかなるときも病める時も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":154.86,"end":156.54,"text":"他の誰かと眠っていても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":156.54,"end":159.04,"text":"お揃いの悪夢でずうっといっしょ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}